      "id": "F-15",
      "severityVerbatim": "低-信息",
      "titleVerbatim": "内存上限语义跨平台不等价，且 Darwin 为**非硬限、可过冲**采样",
      "verbatimReportSection": "### F-15 [低-信息] 内存上限语义跨平台不等价，且 Darwin 为**非硬限、可过冲**采样\n\n- **位置**：`packages/engine/src/ontolearn_engine/memory_guard.py:1-8`（自述「Darwin sampling is not a hard allocation cap and can overshoot between samples」）与 `packages/engine/src/ontolearn_engine/coordinator.py:443-448`（父进程 RSS 采样**仅在 `sys.platform == \"darwin\"` 分支**执行）\n- **影响**：Linux（RLIMIT_AS 虚拟地址空间硬限）/ Windows（Job Object 提交内存硬限）与 Darwin（libproc RSS 采样）三者对 `maxWorkerMemoryBytes` 的保证强度不同；Darwin 下父进程侧**不做**采样兜底，越界只能由子进程自身 guard 捕获。\n- **证据**：`memory_guard.py` 模块 docstring 自述；`coordinator.py:443` 的 `if sys.platform == \"darwin\" and process.returncode is None:`；`packages/engine/tests/test_i04_lifecycle_boundaries.py::test_actual_memory_guard_supports_normal_worker_and_denies_known_oversize` 按 `sys.platform` 断言 `darwin-rss-monitor` / `windows-job` / `linux-rlimit-as` 三种模式。\n- **定级理由**：代码自述清晰、非隐藏；属**口径说明缺失**而非实现错误。\n- **建议**：在能力/限制文档中显式登记三平台保证差异与 Darwin 过冲幅度；Darwin 侧若需硬限须换用其它机制。\n",
      "ownerDisposition": "reported-open-awaiting-adjudication",
      "sourceFixedByOwner": false
    }
  ],
